{
  "uid": "customs-remediation",
  "title": "Customs: Remediation",
  "description": "What was changed and what it closed. Findings and their remediations as Grafana annotations, plus the blocking metric falling away as fixes land.",
  "tags": [
    "customs"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 0,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "liveNow": false,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "weekStart": "",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "Customs findings",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": false,
        "iconColor": "red",
        "type": "dashboard",
        "target": {
          "type": "tags",
          "matchAny": false,
          "tags": [
            "customs"
          ],
          "limit": 100
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "Resolved by remediation",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": false,
        "iconColor": "green",
        "type": "dashboard",
        "target": {
          "type": "tags",
          "matchAny": false,
          "tags": [
            "customs",
            "resolved"
          ],
          "limit": 100
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "asset",
        "label": "Asset",
        "description": "Which asset (the video file stem) this page is about",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "grafanacloud-prom"
        },
        "query": {
          "qryType": 1,
          "query": "label_values(customs_market_status, asset)",
          "refId": "VariableQuery-asset"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(customs_market_status, asset)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "regex": "",
        "sort": 1,
        "hide": 0,
        "skipUrlSync": false,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": false,
        "options": [],
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "annolist",
      "title": "Findings and remediations",
      "description": "Every annotation tagged customs, newest first. Click one to jump to the moment in the ad it marks.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "datasource",
        "uid": "grafana"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 14,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "onlyFromThisDashboard": false,
        "onlyInTimeRange": false,
        "tags": [
          "customs"
        ],
        "limit": 50,
        "showTags": true,
        "showTime": true,
        "showUser": false,
        "navigateToPanel": true,
        "navigateBefore": "10m",
        "navigateAfter": "10m"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How a remediation closes the loop",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "datasource",
        "uid": "grafana"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 10,
        "x": 14,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "### Change records\n\nEvery edit the Remediator makes is written as a change record: what was changed, by which method, and the before and after frame. The annotation list to the left is the Grafana half of that record. A red marker is the finding; a green marker tagged resolved is the remediation that closed it.\n\n### Why the metric falling is the proof\n\nNothing here deletes a Prometheus sample, because you cannot. When a fix lands, the finding stops being pushed, customs_blocking goes stale, the alert rule stops matching and Grafana resolves the alert on its own. The panel below is that moment: the bars drop and stay down.\n\n### What the guard refused\n\nA remediation the guard blocks is not retried quietly. It is surfaced with the reason attached, as a decision for a human to take."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Blocking severity as fixes land",
      "description": "customs_blocking by market and rule. A line ending is a finding that stopped being reported, which is what resolves the alert.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "grafanacloud-prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "grafanacloud-prom"
          },
          "expr": "max by (market, rule_id) (customs_blocking{asset=~\"$asset\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{market}} {{rule_id}}",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc",
          "hideZeros": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "barWidthFactor": 0.9,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            },
            "insertNulls": false,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
